{"id": "189159", "name": "מציאת הטלה על ישר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "innerproduct", "params": ["x", "y"], "body": "block([listarith],listarith:true,ratsimp(conjugate(x).y))"}, {"name": "norm", "params": ["x"], "body": "sqrt(innerproduct(x,x))"}, {"name": "gramschmidt_mat_cols", "params": ["x"], "body": "transpose(apply(matrix,gramschmidt(makelist(list_matrix_entries(row(transpose(x), i)), i, 1, length(transpose(x))))))"}, {"name": "gen_rand_3_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]))"}, {"name": "get_rand_orth_basis", "params": ["n"], "body": "gramschmidt_mat_cols(gen_rand_3_mat(n))"}, {"name": "sxneg", "params": ["x"], "body": "(numberp(x) and is(x<0)) or (not atom(x) and (op(x)=\"+\" or op(x)=\"-\" or (op(x)=\"*\" and numberp(first(args(x))) and is(first(args(x))<0))))"}, {"name": "sxp", "params": ["x"], "body": "if sxneg(x) then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "sxtmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(map(sxp, args(e)), \" \\\\cdot \")"}, {"name": "sxtsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtnsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], if numberp(t) and is(t<0) then concat(\"-\",tex1(-t)) else if sxneg(t) then concat(\"+\",sxp(t)) else concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtsq", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([x:first(args(e))], if (integerp(x) and is(x>=0)) or symbolp(x) then concat(tex1(x), \"^2\") else concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)^2\"))"}, {"name": "sxtsub", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(tex1(first(args(e))), \"-\", sxp(second(args(e))))"}, {"name": "sxv", "params": ["x"], "body": "map(ratsimp, x)"}, {"name": "sxvaT", "params": ["x"], "body": "sxsum(makelist(sxmul(sxv(x)[t,1],sxa[t,1]),t,1,3))"}, {"name": "sxva", "params": ["x"], "body": "ratsimp(sum(sxv(x)[t,1]*sxa[t,1],t,1,3))"}, {"name": "sxP", "params": ["x"], "body": "(sxva(x)/sxaa)*sxa"}, {"name": "sxr", "params": ["x"], "body": "map(ratsimp, sxv(x)-sxP(x))"}, {"name": "sxrrT", "params": ["x"], "body": "sxsum(makelist(sxsq(sxr(x)[t,1]),t,1,3))"}, {"name": "sxrr", "params": ["x"], "body": "ratsimp(sum(sxr(x)[t,1]^2,t,1,3))"}, {"name": "sxdd", "params": ["x"], "body": "dispdp(float(sqrt(sxrr(x))),3)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון הישר הבא ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ L = Span \\{ {{CT:0}} \\} \\]</p><p>והוקטור:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ v = {{CT:1}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו את ההטלה של v על הישר:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>מצאו מה המרחק של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> מהישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(L\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><b>הערה:</b> בסעיף זה עליכם להזין מספר עם בדיוק 3 ספרות אחרי הנקודה (למשל אם המרחק יצא 1/5, הזינו <code dir=\"ltr\">0.200</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחשבים את ההטלה על הישר בנוסחה עם מכפלות פנימיות (סעיף א׳). המרחק מהישר הוא האורך של ההפרש בין הווקטור להטלה שלו (סעיף ב׳).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — סעיף א׳: ההטלה על הישר</b><br>נסמן את הווקטור הפורש את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(L\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a={{CT:2}}\\)</span>. ההטלה האורתוגונלית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(L=\\operatorname{span}\\{a\\}\\)</span> היא<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P_L(v)=\\frac{\\langle v,a\\rangle}{\\langle a,a\\rangle}\\,a \\]</p>מחשבים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\langle v,a\\rangle={{CT:3}}={{CT:4}},\\qquad \\langle a,a\\rangle={{CT:5}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P_L(v)=[[if test=\"{{CT:15}}\"]]\\frac{{{CT:4}}}{{{CT:6}}}{{CT:2}}=[[/if]]\\left({{CT:7}}\\right){{CT:2}}={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סעיף ב׳: המרחק מהישר</b><br>המרחק של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(L\\)</span> הוא האורך של הרכיב הניצב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v-P_L(v)\\)</span> (הווקטור הקרוב ביותר ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(L\\)</span> הוא ההטלה):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ v-P_L(v)={{CT:9}}-{{CT:8}}={{CT:10}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ d(v,L)=\\lVert v-P_L(v)\\rVert=\\sqrt{{{CT:11}}}=\\sqrt{{{CT:12}}}={{CT:13}} \\]</p>ובקירוב, עם 3 ספרות אחרי הנקודה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ d(v,L)\\approx {{CT:14}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "rand_vect[1,1] . col(gs_mat,1)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה, יפה מאוד!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "NumDecPlaces", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "float(sqrt(innerproduct(gs_mat . (rand_vect * matrix([0],[1],[1])), gs_mat . (rand_vect * matrix([0],[1],[1]))  )))", "testoptions": "3", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה, כל הכבוד!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["base_mat", "gs_mat", "rand_vect", "sxa", "sxaa", "sxaaT"], "nvariants": 50}